#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:1
msgid "How to use the render animation command in Krita."
msgstr "Kako uporabljati ukaz za upodabljanje animacije v Kriti."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:13
#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:18
#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:43
msgid "Render Animation"
msgstr "Upodobi animacijo"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:13
msgid "Animation"
msgstr "Animacija"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:20
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Render animation allows you to render your animation to an image sequence, "
"``.gif``, ``.mp4``, ``.mkv``, or ``.ogg`` file. It replaces :guilabel:"
"`Export Animation`."
msgstr ""
"Animacija renderja vam omogoča, da animacijo ukažete na slikovna zaporedja, "
"».gif«, ».mp4«, ».mkv« ali ».ogg«. Nadomešča :guilabel:'Export Animation'."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:22
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For rendering to an animated file format, Krita will first render to a PNG "
"sequence and then use FFmpeg, which is really good at encoding into video "
"files, to render that sequence to an animated file format. The reason for "
"this two-step process is that animation files can be really complex and "
"really big, and this is the best way to allow you to keep control over the "
"export process. For example, if your computer has a hiccup, and one frame "
"saves out weird, first saving the image sequence allows you to only resave "
"that one weird frame before rendering."
msgstr ""
"Za uglasitev v animirano obliko datoteke bo Krita najprej render na PNG "
"zaporedje in nato uporabite FFmpeg, ki je res dober pri kodiranje v video "
"datoteke, da bi to zaporedje v animirano obliko datoteke. Razlog za ta "
"postopek v dveh korakih je, da so lahko animacije datoteke res zapletene in "
"res velike, in to je najboljši način, da vam omogoči, da obdržati nadzor nad "
"izvoznim procesom. Če ima na primer računalnik kolcanje in en okvir shrani "
"čudno, vam najprej shranjevanje slikovnega zaporedja omogoča, da ta en čuden "
"okvir ponovno shranite le pred ugasnjenjem."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:24
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This means that you will need to find a good place to stick your frames "
"before you can start rendering. If you only do throwaway animations, you can "
"use a spot on your hard-drive with enough room and select :guilabel:`Delete "
"Sequence After Rendering`."
msgstr ""
"To pomeni, da boste morali najti dober prostor za vtisovanje okvirjev, "
"preden lahko začnete ulivanje. Če naredite samo zavržne animacije, lahko "
"uporabite mesto na trdem disku z dovolj prostora in izberite :"
"guilabel:'Izbriši zaporedje po ukinitvi'."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:27
msgid "Image Sequence"
msgstr "Sekvenca slik"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:29
msgid "Base Name"
msgstr "Osnova imena"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:30
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The base name of your image sequence. This will get suffixed with a number "
"depending on the frame."
msgstr ""
"Osnovno ime vašega slikovnega zaporedja. To se bo priklopil s številko, "
"odvisno od okvirja."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:31
msgid "File Format"
msgstr "Vrsta datoteke"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:32
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The file format to export the sequence to. When rendering we enforce PNG. "
"The usual export options can be modified with :guilabel:`...`."
msgstr ""
"Oblika datoteke za izvoz zaporedja v. Pri utelešenju izvajamo PNG. Običajne "
"možnosti izvoza lahko spremenite z :guilabel:'...'."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:33
msgid "Render Location"
msgstr "Mesto upodabljanja"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:34
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Where you render the image sequence to. Some people prefer to use a flash-"
"drive or perhaps a harddrive that is fast."
msgstr ""
"Kamor uteleš zaporedje slike. Nekateri ljudje raje uporabljajo flash-drive "
"ali morda trdi pogon, ki je hiter."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:35
msgid "First Frame"
msgstr "Prva sličica"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:36
msgid ""
"The first frame of the range of frames you wish to adjust. Automatically set "
"to the first frame of your current selection in the timeline. This is useful "
"when you only want to re-render a little part."
msgstr ""
"Prva sličica obsega sličic, ki jih želite prilagoditi. Samodejno nastavite "
"na prvo sličico trenutnega izbora na časovnici. To je koristno, če želite "
"ponovno upodobiti le manjši del."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:37
msgid "Last Frame"
msgstr "Zadnja sličica"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:38
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As above, the last frame of the range of frames you wish to adjust. "
"Automatically set to the last frame of your current selection in the "
"timeline."
msgstr ""
"Kot zgoraj, zadnji okvir obsega okvirjev, ki jih želite prilagoditi. "
"Samodejno nastavite na zadnji okvir trenutnega izbora v časovnici."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:40
msgid "Naming Sequence starts with"
msgstr "Poimenovanje sekvence se začne z"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:40
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The frames are named by using :guilabel:`Base Name`  above and adding a "
"number for the frame. This allows you to set where the frame number starts, "
"so rendering from 8 to 10 with starting point 3 will give you images named "
"11 and 15. Useful for programs that don't understand sequences starting with "
"0, or for precision output."
msgstr ""
"Okvirji so imenovani z uporabo :guilabel:'Osnovno ime' zgoraj in dodajanje "
"številke za okvir. To vam omogoča, da nastavite, kje se začne številka "
"okvirja, zato vam bo ugasnjenje od 8 do 10 z začetno točko 3 dalo slike z "
"imenom 11 in 15. Uporabno za programe, ki ne razumejo zaporedja, začenši z "
"0, ali za natančno izhod."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:45
msgid "Render As"
msgstr "Upodobi kot"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:46
msgid ""
"The file format to render to. All except GIF have extra options that can be "
"manipulated via :guilabel:`...`."
msgstr ""
"Oblika zapisa datoteke, v katero želite upodobiti. Vse razen GIF imajo "
"dodatne možnosti, ki jih je mogoče upravljati preko :guilabel:`…`."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:47
msgid "File"
msgstr "Datoteka"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:48
msgid "Location and name of the rendered animation."
msgstr "Mesto in ime upodobljene animacije."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:49
msgid "FFmpeg"
msgstr "FFmpeg"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:50
msgid ""
"The location where your have FFmpeg. If you don't have this, Krita cannot "
"render an animation. For proper GIF support, you will need FFmpeg 2.6, as we "
"use its palettegen functionality."
msgstr ""
"Mesto, kjer se nahaja FFmpeg. Če tega nimate, Krita ne more upodobiti "
"animacije. Za ustrezno podporo za GIF boste potrebovali FFmpeg 2.6, saj "
"uporabljamo njegovo funkcionalnost palettegen."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:52
msgid "Delete Sequence After Rendering"
msgstr "Izbriši sekvenco po upodabljanju"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:52
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Delete the prerendered image sequence after done rendering. This allows you "
"to choose whether to try and save some space, or to save the sequence for "
"when encoding fails."
msgstr ""
"Po opravljenem ulivanju izbrišite vnaprej prikazano zaporedje slike. To vam "
"omogoča, da izberete, ali želite poskusiti shraniti nekaj prostora ali "
"shraniti zaporedje, ko kodiranje ne uspe."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:56
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Krita currently does not support rendering video with transparent elements, "
"and will instead render them as black. To combat this, you can add in a "
"fully colored, opaque layer at the bottom of the file before rendering."
msgstr ""
"Krita trenutno ne podpira uglasitve videoposnetka s preglednimi elementi, in "
"jih bo namesto tega naredila kot črne. Če se želite boriti proti temu, lahko "
"dodate v popolnoma obarvano, nepregledno plast na dnu datoteke pred "
"ugasnjenjem."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:59
msgid "Setting Up Krita for Exporting Animations"
msgstr "Nastavitev Krite za izvoz animacij"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:61
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You will need to download an extra application and link it in Krita for it "
"to work. The application is pretty big (50MB), so the Krita developers "
"didn't want to bundle it with the normal application. The software that we "
"will use is free and called FFmpeg. The following instructions will explain "
"how to get it and set it up. The setup is a one-time thing so you won't have "
"to do it again."
msgstr ""
"Za delo boste morali prenesti dodatno aplikacijo in jo povezati v Kriti. "
"Aplikacija je precej velika (50MB), tako da krita razvijalci niso želeli, da "
"ga paket z normalno aplikacijo. Programska oprema, ki jo bomo uporabili, je "
"brezplačna in se imenuje FFmpeg. Naslednja navodila bodo pojasnila, kako ga "
"dobiti in nastaviti. Nastavitev je enkratna stvar, tako da vam je ne bo "
"treba več narediti."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:64
msgid "Step 1 - Downloading FFmpeg"
msgstr "Korak 1 - Prenos FFmpeg"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:67
#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:96
msgid "For Windows"
msgstr "Za Windows"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:69
msgid "Open the FFmpeg `download page. <https://www.gyan.dev/ffmpeg/builds/>`_"
msgstr ""
"Odprite stran FFmpeg za `prenos <https://www.gyan.dev/ffmpeg/builds/>`_"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:71
msgid ""
"Go to :guilabel:`release` section and choose the download link that says "
"``ffmpeg-release-essentials.zip``."
msgstr ""
"Pojdite na odsek :guilabel:`izdaja (release)` in izberite povezavo za "
"prenos, kjer piše »ffmpeg-release-essentials.zip«."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:75
msgid ""
"**Don't** download the file which filename contains the word ``shared``. It "
"won't work with Krita."
msgstr ""
"**Ne** prenesite datoteke, ki vsebuje besedo »shared« (v skupni rabi). To ne "
"bo delovala s Krito."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:77
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the filename ends with ``.7z``, you can still use it, but then you need "
"to have a program that can open 7zip archives (for example `7zip itself "
"<https://www.gyan.dev/ffmpeg/builds/>`_). In case of a ``.zip`` file, you "
"can open it just using the Windows file browser."
msgstr ""
"Če se ime datoteke konča z ».7z«, ga lahko še vedno uporabljate, vendar "
"morate imeti program, ki lahko odpre arhive 7zip (na primer »7zip sam "
"<https://www.gyan.dev/ffmpeg/builds/>«_). V primeru datoteke ».zip«, jo "
"lahko odprete samo z brskalnikom Windows."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:81
#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:114
msgid "For macOS"
msgstr "Za macOS"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:83
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Please see the section above. However, FFmpeg is obtained from `here "
"<https://evermeet.cx/ffmpeg/>`_ instead. Just pick the big green button on "
"the left under the FFmpeg heading. You will also need an archiving utility "
"that supports .7z, since FFmpeg provides their macOS builds in .7z format. "
"If you don't have one, try something like `Keka <https://www.kekaosx.com>`_."
msgstr ""
"Oglejte si zgornji razdelek. Vendar pa je FFmpeg pridobljen iz \"tukaj "
"<https://evermeet.cx/ffmpeg/>\"_ namesto tega. Samo izberite velik zeleni "
"gumb na levi pod FFmpeg naslovom. Potrebovali boste tudi arhivski "
"pripomoček, ki podpira .7z, saj FFmpeg zagotavlja njihove macOS grade v .7z "
"obliki. Če ga nimaš, poskusi kot Keka <https://www.kekaosx.com>."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:85
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Alternatively you can find the smaller text under the big green button that "
"says :guilabel:`Download as ZIP`. Then you should be able to extract it just "
"using Finder."
msgstr ""
"Druga možnost je, da najdete manjše besedilo pod velikim zelenim gumbom, ki "
"pravi :guilabel:'Prenesi kot ZIP'. Potem bi morali biti sposobni, da ga "
"izvlečete samo z Finder."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:88
#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:119
msgid "For Linux"
msgstr "Za Linux"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:90
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"FFmpeg can be installed from the repositories on most Linux systems. Version "
"2.6 is required for proper GIF support, as we use the palettegen "
"functionality."
msgstr ""
"FFmpeg je mogoče namestiti iz repositorije v večini Linux sistemov. "
"Različica 2.6 je potrebna za pravilno GIF podporo, saj uporabljamo paletegen "
"funkcionalnost."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:93
msgid "Step 2 - Unzipping and Linking to Krita"
msgstr "Korak 2 - Odpakiranje in povezovanje s Krito"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:98
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once you've downloaded, go to the file location. Right click on the FFmpeg "
"file, and select ``Extract All...``. Select the file destination, and rename "
"the file to 'ffmpeg'."
msgstr ""
"Ko prenesete datoteko, pojdite na mesto datoteke. Z desno tipko miške "
"kliknite datoteko FFmpeg in izberite »Izvleci vse...''. Izberite cilj "
"datoteke in preimenujte datoteko v \"ffmpeg\"."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:100
msgid "Hint"
msgstr "Namig"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:102
msgid ""
"It is easiest to save the file under C: drive, but any location is fine."
msgstr ""
"Datoteko je najlažje shraniti na pogon C:, vendar je vsako mesto primerno."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:104
msgid ""
"Open Krita back up and go to :menuselection:`File --> Render Animation...`. "
"Under ``Export > Video``, click the file icon next to FFmpeg. Select this "
"file ``C:/ffmpeg/bin/ffmpeg.exe`` and click :guilabel:`OK`."
msgstr ""
"Odprite varnostno kopijo Krite in pojdite na :menuselection:`Datoteka --> "
"Upodobi animacijo …`. V razdelku »Izvozi > Video« kliknite ikono datoteke "
"poleg možnosti FFmpeg. Izberite datoteko !C:/ffmpeg/bin/ffmpeg.exe! in "
"kliknite :guilabel:`V redu`."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:109
msgid "Tip"
msgstr "Nasvet"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:111
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you have saved FFmpeg to a different location, choose ``<ffmpeg location>/"
"ffmpeg/bin/ffmpeg.exe``."
msgstr ""
"Če ste shranili FFmpeg na drugo lokacijo, izberite ''<ffmpeg location>/"
"ffmpeg/bin/ffmpeg.exe''.</ffmpeg>"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:116
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"After downloading FFmpeg, you just need to extract it and then simply point "
"to it in the FFmpeg location in Krita like ``/Users/user/Downloads/ffmpeg`` "
"(assuming you downloaded and extracted the .7z file to /Users/user/"
"Downloads)."
msgstr ""
"Po prenosu FFmpeg, morate samo izvleči in nato preprosto pokažite na to na "
"FFmpeg lokacijo v Krita kot \"/Uporabniki/uporabnik/Downloads/ffmpeg\" (ob "
"predpostavki, da ste prenesli in izvlečete datoteko .7z na /Uporabniki/"
"uporabnik/Downloads)."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:121
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"FFmpeg is, if installed from the repositories, usually found in ``/usr/bin/"
"ffmpeg``."
msgstr ""
"FFmpeg je, če je nameščen iz repositorije, običajno najdemo v ''/usr/bin/"
"ffmpeg''."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:124
msgid "Step 3 - Testing out an animation"
msgstr "3. korak - Preizkušanje animacije"

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:126
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"ffmpeg.exe is what Krita uses to do all of its animation export magic. Now "
"that it is hooked up, let us test it out."
msgstr ""
"ffmpeg.exe je tisto, kar Krita uporablja za vse svoje animacije izvoz "
"čarovnije. Zdaj, ko je privezana, ga preizkusimo."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:128
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Let's make an animated GIF. In the Render Animation dialog, change the :"
"guilabel:`Render As`  field to \"GIF image\". Choose the file location where "
"it will save with the \"File\" menu below. I just saved it to my desktop and "
"called it \"*export.gif*\". When it is done, you should be able to open it "
"up and see the animation."
msgstr ""
"Naredimo animirani GIF. V pogovornem oknu Animacija renderja spremenite "
"polje :guilabel:'Render As' v »GIF slika«. Izberite lokacijo datoteke, kjer "
"jo shranite v spodnjem meniju »Datoteka«. Pravkar sem ga shranil na namizje "
"in mu rekel \"*izvoz.gif*\". Ko je to končano, bi morali biti sposobni "
"odpreti in si oglejte animacijo."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:132
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"By default, FFmpeg will render MP4 files with a too new codec, which means "
"that Windows Media Player won't be able to play it. So for Windows, select "
"\"baseline\" for the profile instead of \"high422\" before rendering."
msgstr ""
"FFmpeg privzeto ukaže MP4 datoteke s preveč novim kodeko, kar pomeni, da ga "
"Windows Media Player ne bo mogel predvajati. Za Windows izberite »izhodišče« "
"za profil namesto »high422«, preden ga ukažete."

#: ../../reference_manual/render_animation.rst:136
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"macOS does not come with any software to play MP4 and MKV files. If you use "
"Chrome for your web browser, you can drag the video file into that and the "
"video should play. Otherwise you will need to get a program like VLC to see "
"the video."
msgstr ""
"macOS ne prihaja z nobeno programsko opremo za predvajanje MP4 in MKV "
"datotek. Če chrome uporabljate za spletni brskalnik, lahko v to povlečete "
"video datoteko in videoposnetek naj se predvaja. V nasprotnem primeru boste "
"morali dobiti program, kot je VLC, da si oglejte video."
